            "text": "structure ContinuousMap (X Y : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] [TopologicalSpace Y] where\n  /-- The function `X → Y` -/\n  protected toFun : X → Y\n  /-- Proposition that `toFun` is continuous -/\n  protected continuous_toFun : Continuous toFun := by fun_prop"
